actice","type":"choice","title":"Listen to the riddles. Choose the place.","prompt":"5 — You can sleep here on holiday.","options":["a museum","an museum","a hotel"],"answer":"a hotel"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"rows","title":"Neft Dashlari — the town in the Caspian Sea.","sub":"","track":"A1_L13_4_1.mp3","items":[{"q":"How many people live there?","options":["2,000","300","20,000"],"answer":"2,000"},{"q":"Are there any restaurants?","options":["Yes — some nice restaurants and hotels.","No, there aren't.","2,000"],"answer":"Yes — some nice restaurants and hotels."},{"q":"Who can go to Neft Dashlari?","options":["Anyone with a ticket","Only people who work there","Only tourists"],"answer":"Only people who work there"}]},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Design the perfect neighbourhood — together.","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"In my perfect neighbourhood there's…"}]}